{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2023-01-17 16:15:00', 'title': 'VEHICLE SERVICE GROUP LAUNCHES THE ALLONWALL SERIES, A NEW WHEEL ALIGNER CONCEPT', 'text': "DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JAN. 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- VEHICLE SERVICE GROUP\xa0(VSG), PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) AND ONE OF THE WORLD'S LEADING AUTOMOTIVE EQUIPMENT COMPANIES, ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE ALLONWALL SERIES, A NEW WHEEL ALIGNER CONCEPT UNDER THE ROTARY AND RAVAGLIOLI BRANDS IN THE EMEA (EUROPE, THE MIDDLE EAST AND AFRICA) REGION."}